          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "`_logger.exception(...)` captures the active exception via `exc_info=True`. When called outside an `except:` block there is no active exception, so it logs `NoneType: None` or nothing at all - a `_logger.error(\"event_name\", error=str(e), error_type=type(e).__name__)`."
          },
